# JBoss Application Server
# website: https://jbossas.jboss.org
# docs: https://docs.jboss.org/jbossas/docs/
# description: Legacy JBoss Application Server 4.x-6.x (superseded by WildFly) server profile runtime data, logs, temp and JSP work directories, and deployment markers

# Server profile runtime data
**/server/*/data/

# Server profile logs
**/server/*/log/

# Server profile temp files
**/server/*/tmp/

# Server profile JSP work files
**/server/*/work/

# Deployment markers
**/server/*/deploy/*.failed
*.DEPLOYED